"""
Mapa de Movilidad Internacional — SICUE / Erasmus
=================================================

Streamlit single-file app.  Drop this file in a GitHub repo and point
share.streamlit.io at it — no other assets are needed, the two maps are
embedded at the bottom of this file as base64 WebP.

HOW TO ADD / EDIT A UNIVERSITY
------------------------------
Edit the SPAIN / EUROPE / OUTSIDE_EUROPE lists in the CONFIG block below.
You only ever provide real-world latitude / longitude — the app projects
them onto the maps for you (Spain map: equirectangular; Europe map:
Lambert azimuthal equal-area).  Look a city up on any maps site, copy the
two numbers, done.

Statuses are the four keys of STATUSES: "agreement" (green),
"progress" (yellow), "contacted" (red), "na" (blue).

NOTE: the projection constants in the CALIBRATION block are fitted to the
two bundled map images.  If you swap the images you must re-fit them.
"""

